cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "Reconciling droplet freezing parameterizations with cloud top phase and ice number observations: code and run configurations"
version: 1.0.2
abstract: "Patches against CAM tag cam_cesm2_1_rel_60 of CESM 2.1.5 that add a droplet freezing limiter for mineral dust (limfacdu), the Niemand et al. (2012) dust immersion freezing schemes, a switch for the MG2 ice-number cap and related microphysics factors and diagnostics. The repository also contains the run namelists and case scripts of the CESM2/CAM6 (MG2) simulations of Villanueva et al. (in review). Release 1.0.2 changes only documentation and metadata; the code is identical to release 1.0.1."
date-released: 2026-11-18
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/diegovillanueva/mg2_limiter_update"
authors:
  - family-names: Villanueva
    given-names: Diego
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-3673-5706"
    affiliation: "Institute for Atmospheric and Climate Science, ETH Zurich, Zurich, Switzerland"
keywords:
  - CESM2
  - CAM6
  - MG2 microphysics
  - ice nucleation
  - mineral dust
  - mixed-phase clouds
